{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist has fallen into debt and is forced to work under harsh conditions in a mine.<br>Dig deeper and deeper toward the bottom to break free from this unreasonable life of labor!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig through the ground, you\u2019ll unearth a variety of ores.<br>Sell the ores you collect to earn money, upgrade your <strong>battery</strong> and <strong>shovel</strong>, and keep digging endlessly.<br>Some rocks are too tough for your shovel\u2014use <strong>dynamite</strong> to blast your way through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful about your <strong>battery consumption</strong>.<br>Without power, your life in the depths will come to an end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect around 0.5<strong>\u00a0to 3 hours</strong> to reach the ending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement:</strong> WASD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shovel:</strong> Left Mouse Button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shovel Happy Mode:</strong> Left Mouse Button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light:</strong> F Key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place Ladder:</strong> R / V Key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamite:</strong> T Key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump / Jetpack:</strong> Space Key (press again mid-air to activate jetpack)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4080600?t=1761633443","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4080600?t=1761633443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080600/0a4876b344d2ee76268e82e7d1425975d7d32499/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761633443","capsule_imagev5":"https://sha